 ('Rasululloh sollallohu alayhi vasallamning bir kunlari','Abdulaziz Usmon',3,33990,40000,null,'Hilol-nashr',10,true,'https://images.uzum.uz/d0vv86r3uvpglcmaikd0/t_product_540_high.jpg','Payg''ambarimiz sollallohu alayhi vasallamning odatiy bir kunlari qanday o''tgani oson tilda bayon qilingan. Oyat va hadislardan dalillar keltirilgan. Kirill yozuvida, 2023-yil nashri.'),
 ('Qissasul anbiyo (Payg''ambarlar tarixi)','Ibn Kasir',3,149990,null,798,null,10,false,'https://images.uzum.uz/d6ctad09oh610dh85uh0/t_product_540_high.jpg','Odam alayhissalomdan Muhammad sollallohu alayhi vasallamgacha barcha payg''ambarlarning hayoti, mo''jizalari va qavmlari bilan bo''lgan voqealar.'),
 ('Chahoriyorlar – to''rt buyuk sahobiy',null,3,296010,null,null,null,10,false,'https://images.uzum.uz/d7n4et21146tv06racrg/t_product_540_high.jpg','Abu Bakr, Umar, Usmon va Ali roziyallohu anhumning hayoti, fazilatlari va Islomni yoyishdagi o''rni. Ular haqidagi hadislar asosida.'),
 ('Imom A''zam',null,3,49990,null,null,null,10,false,'https://images.uzum.uz/d88u3mbsv8vo2t0h0ik0/t_product_540_high.jpg','Hanafiy mazhabi asoschisi Imom Abu Hanifaning hayoti va yo''li ilmiy manbalar asosida. Asarlaridan namunalar, shogirdlariga nasihatlari va zamondoshlarining xotiralari bilan.'),
 ('Iymon','Shayx Muhammad Sodiq Muhammad Yusuf',4,62000,null,null,'Hilol-nashr',10,false,'https://images.uzum.uz/d0lib70n274j5scnfjtg/t_product_540_high.jpg','Islomning asosi bo''lgan iymon haqida. Ikkinchi nashrga sunnat, shariat va Islomda ayollar huquqlari kabi mavzulardagi yangi maqolalar qo''shilgan.'),
 ('Allohning borligiga aqliy dalillar',null,4,59490,null,null,null,10,false,'https://images.uzum.uz/d88tmibsv8vo2t0h0bdg/t_product_540_high.jpg','Borliq nima uchun yaratilgan degan savollarga aqliy dalillar bilan javob beruvchi kitob.'),
 ('Kifoya (1-2-3 juz, qutida)','Shayx Muhammad Sodiq Muhammad Yusuf',5,375000,null,null,'Hilol-nashr',10,false,'https://images.uzum.uz/d40q4bdv2sjj05os0alg/t_product_540_high.jpg','Hanafiy fiqhining mumtoz matni "Muxtasarul viqoya"ning tarjima va sharhi. 1-juz tahorat va namoz, 2-3-juzlar fiqhning boshqa boblari. Uch juz bitta qutida, kirill yozuvida.'),
 ('Baxtiyor oila (lotin yozuvida)','Shayx Muhammad Sodiq Muhammad Yusuf',5,95000,110000,null,'Hilol-nashr',10,false,'https://images.uzum.uz/d0vv9ni7s4fq7e8u2dbg/t_product_540_high.jpg','Oila hayotiga oid shar''iy hukmlarning mufassal sharhi: er-xotinning haq-huquqlari, ota-ona bilan munosabat, farzand tarbiyasi. Oyat, hadis va solih salaflar hayotidan misollar bilan.'),
 ('Odoblar xazinasi (1-4 juz)',null,6,349000,471200,null,'Hilol-nashr',10,false,'https://images.uzum.uz/d1014nr3uvpglcmaj9h0/t_product_540_high.jpg','Qur''on, sunnat va solih ulamolar nasihatlaridan jamlangan odob qoidalari, to''rt juzda. Kundalik hayot, oila, muomala va ruhiy kamolot bo''yicha amaliy ko''rsatmalar. Kirill yozuvida, 2021-yil.'),
 ('Solihlar hayotidan (sara naql va xabarlar)',null,6,69000,80000,null,'Hilol-nashr',10,false,'https://images.uzum.uz/d6a4c57qkmalqfncd60g/t_product_540_high.jpg','Solih insonlar hayotidan ibratli qissalar, hikmatli so''zlar va ta''sirli voqealar: taqvo, sabr, ixlos va kamtarlik namunalari. Kirill yozuvida.'),
 ('Ey farzand','Imom G''azzoliy',6,30000,35000,null,'Hilol-nashr',10,false,'https://images.uzum.uz/d406l5dv2sjj05orqq9g/t_product_540_high.jpg','Imom G''azzoliyning yoshlarga va ruhiy kamolot istagan har bir kishiga nasihatlari: nafs tarbiyasi, axloq, ixlos va Alloh bilan munosabat. Yumshoq muqova, kirill yozuvida.'),
 ('Bolalar uchun 40 hadis hikoyalari, 100 qisqa hadis, Robbimning 99 go''zal ismi (3 kitob)',null,7,22000,null,296,null,10,false,'https://images.uzum.uz/cq2cdl36eisq2rkefbhg/t_product_540_high.jpg','Bolalar uchun uch kitob: 40 hadis qisqa va tushunarli hikoyalarda (87 bet), 100 qisqa hadis (108 bet) va Allohning 99 go''zal ismi (101 bet). Rangli rasmlar bilan, 14×20 sm.');
